WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.360
AI mentioned this brand most.

00:00:02.560 --> 00:00:04.700
One budget answer ruled it out.

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:08.400
In Recoscope’s November ninth
protein powder snapshot,

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:10.560
Optimum Nutrition appeared in

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:12.840
eight of twelve usable answers.

00:00:13.060 --> 00:00:15.380
Transparent Labs appeared in seven,

00:00:15.460 --> 00:00:18.500
but ranked first in
three of four comparisons.

00:00:18.940 --> 00:00:21.540
Optimum Nutrition ranked first once.

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:24.550
Then we asked for options
under fifty dollars.

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:27.880
Three assistants mentioned
Optimum Nutrition.

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:30.920
Perplexity mentioned it
specifically to say

00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:33.240
the listings it found
were over budget.

00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:35.160
That still counts as a mention.

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:38.500
It does not count as a positive
budget recommendation.

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:41.800
For brands, measure
how often you appear,

00:00:41.960 --> 00:00:45.200
where you rank, and what
the answer actually says.

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:48.200
These findings describe
captured answers,

00:00:48.380 --> 00:00:49.800
not product quality.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:53.240
Explore benchmark at
getrecoscope.com.
